      "title": "How to choose a perfume you won't get tired of",
      "slug": "how-to-choose-a-perfume",
      "excerpt": "Top, heart and base notes, and why you should wait an hour before you decide.",
      "content": "## Start with the notes\n\nA perfume changes as it dries. The **top notes** fade within minutes, the **heart** lasts a few hours and the **base** stays all day.\n\n## Test on skin\n\nPaper strips only show the top notes. Spray a tester on your wrist and wait at least an hour.",
